@namespace Atlas.Showcase.Components

<div class="showcase-tool">
    <TeachingCard Requirement="REQ-F-035 · REQ-F-116 · REQ-F-117 · REQ-F-118"
                  Source="AtlasKeyboardCommandMap.cs"
                  CodeSnippet="@ShowcaseSnippets.KeyboardBinding">
        <p>Atlas 将键盘快捷键映射到与指针相同的 Core 操作。方向键调整
        已聚焦分割条的大小；<span class="showcase-kbd">Ctrl</span>+<span class="showcase-kbd">Tab</span>
        切换编辑器标签页；<span class="showcase-kbd">Ctrl</span>+<span class="showcase-kbd">Shift</span>+<span class="showcase-kbd">Tab</span>
        反向切换；<span class="showcase-kbd">Ctrl</span>+<span class="showcase-kbd">W</span>
        关闭当前可关闭标签页；<span class="showcase-kbd">Alt</span>+方向键切换面板焦点。</p>
        <p><span class="showcase-tag accent">试一试</span> 点击
        <strong>快捷键速查</strong> 或 <strong>使用指南</strong> 标签页，
        然后按 <span class="showcase-kbd">Ctrl</span>+<span class="showcase-kbd">Tab</span>
        切换。命令映射可以重新绑定任意操作。</p>
    </TeachingCard>
</div>
